      <PointerOffset>47208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>アイオラ姉さんのソーマ
『バルハイト』を裏切り者の
身内が身に着けているなんて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Iola's dear Soma Warheit is being worn by a descendant of a traitor...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……あのソーマは
この里に眠るのがふさわしい……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...That Soma deserves to rest in peace in our village...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
