    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52328</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>むぅぅ……
難しいっぺ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Grr... This is hard.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52328</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やはり『女王茸』の栽培は
無理なんかのぉ……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Shoulda guessed a queen mushrooms'd be tricky to grow, eh? </EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52328</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『ネコ茸』や『紳士男茸』の
栽培には成功したんだけどなぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Reckon I'd have more luck tryin' a cat mushrooms, or maybe a gentleman mushroom...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52328</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>つ、ついにやっただッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Finally, I've done it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52328</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ついに『女王茸』の養殖に
成功しただっっ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I finally grew that bloomin' queen mushroom!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52328</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うう……長年の苦労が
むくわれただ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahh... All those years of hard work are finally payin' off!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52328</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>自分自身に金メダル……
いや、菌メダルをあげたいだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I reckon I deserve a gold medal... Nah, I want a mushroom medal!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
