    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52420</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はぁ……
また失敗だっぺよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Argh... I mucked it up again.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52420</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『女王茸』ってめずらしぃ
キノコの栽培に挑戦してんだけんど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm havin' a crack at growin' the rare “queen mushroom.”</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52420</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんどやっても
うまく育たねぇんだよぉ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But every time I try, the bloody thing just won't grow...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52420</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やっただよぉー！
『女王茸』を栽培できたんだよ♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've done it! I grew a queen mushroom! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52420</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>できあがった『女王茸』は
素材屋で買えるだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You can go 'n pick one up at the general store if ya want.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
