    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Hisui&gt;、&lt;Kohaku&gt;……
里長様には黙っててやるから
家に戻るだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Hisui&gt;, &lt;Kohaku&gt;. I'll keep this a secret from the chief, so go back to your house.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……外界の事なんか
放っておけばいいだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't worry about what's going on in the outside world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すんごい爆発だったべ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That was a massive explosion.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なにが起こったんだべか？
ま、まさか里長様が……!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's going on? Don't tell me the chief did this?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Hisui&gt;、&lt;Kohaku&gt;……
……たまには帰って来い</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Hisui&gt; and &lt;Kohaku&gt;. Make sure to stop by home every so often.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>5</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……遠慮はいらねぇ！
このノークインは、おめぇたちの
生まれ故郷なんだからなぁ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't hold back! Norqueen is always a place you can call home, after all!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
